cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Estonian Legal Ontology
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Aavik
    given-names: Henrik
    website: https://github.com/henrikaavik
repository-code: https://github.com/henrikaavik/estonian-legal-ontology
url: https://w3id.org/estleg/
abstract: >-
  A machine-readable JSON-LD ontology of Estonian and EU law
  (enacted laws, domestic regulations, drafts, Riigikohus and
  EU court decisions, EUR-Lex acts) under the estleg namespace.
  Licence scope: the dataset has no single licence, so this file
  declares none. The original compilation layer (selection and
  arrangement, minted estleg: IRIs, the ontology/TBox, and derived
  links) is offered under CC BY 4.0. The third-party legal texts
  keep their source rights: EU material is reused under Commission
  Decision 2011/833/EU, and Estonian legal texts are not objects of
  copyright (Autoriõiguse seadus § 5). Each distribution's licence
  is in metadata.jsonld. See the top-level NOTICE and
  docs/DATA_RIGHTS.md before redistributing.
keywords:
  - estonia
  - law
  - ontology
  - json-ld
  - rdf
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-19"
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: https://w3id.org/estleg/1.0.0
    description: Ontology version IRI; the w3id.org PURL is registered and resolves (#690)
